# Bass: notes held together are bowed together on adjacent strings.
# A line on the G string over a held open D, then sustained and short chords.
tempo 60
0 poly on
0 dyn 0.5
0 vib 0.5
0 on D2 70              # open D, held under the line on the G string
0 note G2 1.05 70
1 note A2 1.05 70
2 note B2 1.05 70
3 note A2 1.9 80
3 off D2
5 note A1 1.9 70        # a sixth: open A, F#2 on the D string
5 note F#2 1.9 70
7 note E1 1.9 70        # a fifth: open E, B1 on the A string
7 note B1 1.9 70
9 bow on
9 note A1 0.2 90        # short chords on the string: both notes in one stroke
9 note E2 0.2 90
9.5 note A1 0.2 90
9.5 note E2 0.2 90
10 note E1 0.2 90
10 note B1 0.2 90
